<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth"><head><meta charSet="utf-8" data-next-head=""/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" data-next-head=""/><link rel="canonical" href="https://replit.com/blog/introducing-replit-agent" data-next-head=""/><title data-next-head="">Introducing Replit Agent | Replit</title><meta name="description" content="Last week, we launched Replit Agent, our AI system that can create and deploy applications. Now, with only a few sentences and a few minutes, you can take..." data-next-head=""/><meta name="author" content="The Replit Team" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:title" content="Introducing Replit Agent | Replit" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:description" content="Last week, we launched Replit Agent, our AI system that can create and deploy applications. Now, with only a few sentences and a few minutes, you can take an application from idea to deployment.

You can think about the Agent like a pair programmer. It configures your development environment, installs dependencies, and executes code. From your laptop or the Replit mobile app, the Agent is changing how our users build software.

If you&#x27;d like to learn more, we&#x27;ve compiled some of our favorite examples, tutorials, and articles on the agent so far." data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:image" content="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/bj34pdbp/migration/6bbe03f8f6670b91d0939d3b3fb328e105fc89ea-1809x1017.png?w=1200&amp;h=630&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:type" content="article" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:url" content="https://replit.com/blog/introducing-replit-agent" data-next-head=""/><meta property="og:site_name" content="Replit Blog" data-next-head=""/><meta property="fb:app_id" content="1775481339348651" data-next-head=""/><meta property="article:published_time" content="2024-09-16T17:36:53.567Z" data-next-head=""/><meta property="article:modified_time" content="2025-04-25T20:31:59.000Z" data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:site" content="@replit" data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:title" content="Introducing Replit Agent | Replit" data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Last week, we launched Replit Agent, our AI system that can create and deploy applications. Now, with only a few sentences and a few minutes, you can take an application from idea to deployment.

You can think about the Agent like a pair programmer. It configures your development environment, installs dependencies, and executes code. From your laptop or the Replit mobile app, the Agent is changing how our users build software.

If you&#x27;d like to learn more, we&#x27;ve compiled some of our favorite examples, tutorials, and articles on the agent so far." data-next-head=""/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/bj34pdbp/migration/6bbe03f8f6670b91d0939d3b3fb328e105fc89ea-1809x1017.png?w=1200&amp;h=630&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg" data-next-head=""/><script type="application/ld+json" data-next-head="">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://replit.com#organization","name":"Replit","url":"https://replit.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","@id":"https://replit.com#logo","url":"https://cdn.replit.com/dotcom/logo.png","contentUrl":"https://cdn.replit.com/dotcom/logo.png"},"description":"Replit is an AI-powered software development platform where builders can write, collaborate, and ship code directly from the browser.","sameAs":["https://x.com/replit","https://www.linkedin.com/company/repl-it/","https://www.instagram.com/repl.it/","https://www.facebook.com/replit/","https://www.tiktok.com/@replit","https://github.com/replit","https://www.youtube.com/@replit","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Replit"],"contactPoint":{"@type":"ContactPoint","contactType":"customer support","url":"https://replit.com"}},{"@type":"Blog","@id":"https://replit.com/blog#blog","url":"https://replit.com/blog","name":"Replit Blog","publisher":{"@id":"https://replit.com#organization"}},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@id":"https://replit.com/blog/introducing-replit-agent#breadcrumb","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Replit Blog","item":"https://replit.com/blog"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Introducing Replit Agent","item":"https://replit.com/blog/introducing-replit-agent"}]},{"@type":"BlogPosting","url":"https://replit.com/blog/introducing-replit-agent","@id":"https://replit.com/blog/introducing-replit-agent#blogposting","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","url":"https://replit.com/blog/introducing-replit-agent","@id":"https://